:: UseCursedItem [nobr] {"position":"2200,1250","size":"100,100"}
/* Video lookup reads the carried type *before* we consume it, then
   the run below clears the type flag + held marker so the player isn't
   stuck holding a phantom item (which would otherwise block Brook from
   fetching another and leave the witch unable to take a turn-in). */
<<set _vid to setup.HauntedHouses.cursedItemVideo()>>
<<run setup.Witch.consumeCarriedCursedItem()>>
<br>
<<if _vid>>
	<<video _vid "displayCentredImgs">><br>
	@@.mc-speech; Ah~ I can't... and don't want to... stop <br>@@
	@@.mc-thoughts; You play with yourself until you cum @@<br>@@.mc-speech; Ohh, I feel wonderful.@@<br>

<</if>>
<<addclass "body" "style-video-height">>
<br>
@@.backbtn; [[Back|previous()]]@@
<<done>>
	<<addclass ".linkselector" "disabled-link">>
<</done>>
